# Documentation Standard

- Document structural, schema, integration, design-token, and security-policy changes (purpose, blast radius, migration/recovery, verification, rollback).
- Single source of truth per concern: README, CODEMAP, ARCHITECTURE, DESIGN, TYPEGUIDE, CHANGELOG, `.cursor/rules/`, `docs/`.
- Do not duplicate the same policy in rules + skills + Korean guide—link instead.

Korean rationale: `docs/pvc-guide/ko/docs/documentation-standard.md`
